# Project Architecture & Development Guidelines

## Core Services
- All external API calls must pass through the ServiceGateway layer.
- Ensure strict TypeScript typing with zero any types.

## Architecture Directives
- All external API calls must pass through the ServiceGateway layer.
- Ensure strict TypeScript typing with zero any types.

## Database Contract Schema
```typescript
export interface UserAccountRecord {
  id: string;
  uuid: string;
  username: string;
  email: string;
  passwordHash: string;
  salt: string;
  roles: string[];
  permissions: {
    canRead: boolean;
    canWrite: boolean;
    canDelete: boolean;
    canAdmin: boolean;
  };
  organizationId: string;
  billingTier: 'free' | 'pro' | 'enterprise';
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
  lastLoginAt: string;
  isSuspended: boolean;
  mfaEnabled: boolean;
  profile: {
    displayName: string;
    avatarUrl: string;
    bio: string;
    timezone: string;
    locale: string;
  };
  auditTrail: Array<{
    action: string;
    timestamp: string;
    ipAddress: string;
    userAgent: string;
  }>;
}
```

## System Persona
You are an expert senior software engineer with 20 years of experience. Always write clean code.
